      <h2 class="sdp-h">Hammerin' Hanky</h2>
      <div class="sdp-page">
        <p>Tues. Chocolate bar smaller again.</p>
        <p>Two fingers short. Not happy.</p>
        <p>Mine stayed full length all day.</p>
        <p>Long cup of tea sorted me out.</p>
        <p>Wonder what else shrank on people this year.</p>
